    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/e4b421fa289c27150912511760147ed0.webp?t=1732666238\" /></div><br>Hello! Welcome to the 'about this game' section for The Dreamer Must Die. Don't forget to SMASH that Wishlist button and give a Follow. I hope you really enjoy this game description dude, it's So Awesome!! You can trust me, I'm a cute lil' smiley guy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/f737e71a2cd7b44c47fbce4d66e8a694.avif?t=1732666238\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/dc146a49c75f872a4d3e980ee74fe4e6.poster.avif?t=1732666238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/dc146a49c75f872a4d3e980ee74fe4e6.webm?t=1732666238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>A mysterious figure named The Dreamer has appeared in the dream world, and summoned an ominous tower that looms over the sky. If that's not bad enough, shadowy creatures have begun to spawn and is causing all forms of torment on the residents. However, they do have one last hope left, you. <i>But is hope really enough?</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/436ff498a80780586418dfd0e5f07dbd.poster.avif?t=1732666238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/436ff498a80780586418dfd0e5f07dbd.webm?t=1732666238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The dream has become a dangerous nightmare, infested with shadow-spawn that appear in many varieties. Utilize a wide range of equipment, level your character, upgrade your arms, to make the most of you are given. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/34f50a8d44a6cd68d5da4cb64b559ffb.poster.avif?t=1732666238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/34f50a8d44a6cd68d5da4cb64b559ffb.webm?t=1732666238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/c7d09eb18a0d215afe805e8c49c04654.poster.avif?t=1732666238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/c7d09eb18a0d215afe805e8c49c04654.webm?t=1732666238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/a1d3d0d73531760fc3764588fd4d5b2f.poster.avif?t=1732666238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/a1d3d0d73531760fc3764588fd4d5b2f.webm?t=1732666238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/87a29a4c798ee80d684918a8116b9265.poster.avif?t=1732666238\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/87a29a4c798ee80d684918a8116b9265.apng?t=1732666238\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Ahlquist Interactive is a startup development studio. A.I. hell-bent on the goal of creating fun and unique games that leave a lasting impression. Currently on this project there's Hunter Ahlquist for programming, art assets, and direction, and John Della Franco for music.<br>Be sure to join the A.I. Discord server and drop a hello!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/e4b421fa289c27150912511760147ed0.webp?t=1732666238\" /></div><br>WOW, you really read all of that! I'll be honest, that description reads like every other description on this platform, I'm surprised that your eyes didn't roll to the back of your head. And I mean who even is this &quot;Hunter Ahlquist&quot; guy anyway? He introduced himself like some kind of household name... Regardless, I <i>hope</i> you're interested in the game, Hunter wont feed me until I hit my wishlist quota.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116590/extras/aa6b048d77805512077554d20c2ce4cb.avif?t=1732666238\" /></div>",
